# Atlas Desktop — secrets & credentials. Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit `.env`.
# (`.env` is git-ignored. Never paste real keys anywhere but this local file.)

# --- The brain ---
# No Anthropic API key needed: the Claude Agent SDK uses your Claude Code login.
# Just make sure the Claude Code CLI is installed and signed in:
#   npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code   &&   claude   (log in once)

# --- Voice: Gemini (default, key-only) ---
# Your Gemini API key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Tip: restrict this key (API + app restrictions) in the Google Cloud console.
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# --- Wake word "Hey Atlas" ---
# Free access key from https://console.picovoice.ai
PICOVOICE_ACCESS_KEY=...

# --- OPTIONAL: only if you switch stt/tts provider to "google-chirp" in config.yaml ---
# Real Google Cloud "Chirp" needs a Cloud project with Speech-to-Text + Text-to-Speech
# enabled and a service-account JSON. Leave blank if you're using Gemini.
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/gcp-service-account.json
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
